-- Seed: Shodamania Aesthetics exercise library (bilingual HR/EN).
-- Source: "Shodamania Aesthetics Exercise Database.csv" (~200 real rows).
-- Each row provides a Croatian display name (`name`, UNIQUE) and an English
-- translation (`name_en`), plus the verbatim Croatian setup note (`notes`) and
-- its English translation (`notes_en`). muscle_group + equipment are inferred
-- in Croatian; difficulty is always NULL; created_by is the Shodamania coach.
--
-- Notes / dedupe:
--   * Skipped CSV row "Zgibovi" (NO.28) — already exists in the seed library.
--   * Collapsed exact-duplicate CSV names into a single row (keeping the copy
--     that has a note/video): "DB Incline Press" (NO.10 + NO.60),
--     "Stationary/DB Stationary Lunge" (NO.115 + NO.116 + NO.133),
--     "DB Step-ups"/"DB Box Step-Ups" (NO.102 + NO.180, identical video).
--   * Croatian names disambiguated with qualifiers where two different English
--     exercises would otherwise collide (e.g. cable vs. dumbbell lateral raise).
--   * The bare "www.youtube.com" homepage link on NO.1 is stored as NULL.

